    - target: {fileID: 8264858998966735158, guid: bb2052d9134d6de48bb6671a51b88fad, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Engine presets are available for use in the newest nightly build!\n\r\nEngine
        presets allow you to change basic properties of the engine such as the hit
        window size, various leniencies such as strum leniencies, and also toggle
        features such as anti-ghosting and infinite front-end. They work for guitar
        and drums only.\n\r\nYou can create custom presets in the Settings menu in
        the Customization tab, and export them for your friends to use! YARG also
        comes with some basic presets of its own:\_Default\_(duh),\_Casual, and\_Precision.\n\r\nHere
        are the settings for those presets,\_as of the time of this article releasing.
        These will most likely change ..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
